commit 34e24ea2
author: cdvankammen
date: 2026-10-22 12:07:11 -0600
subject: feat(observability): add markdown request log auto-flush to ~/.9router/logs

- New src/lib/markdownLog.js: opt-in timer (settings.markdownLogEnabled,
  markdownLogFlushIntervalMin default 5) that rewrites the daily
  YYYY-MM-DD.md report with the last 24h of request details, grouped by
  conversation. Fail-open, re-reads settings each tick, started from
  instrumentation.js (unref'd timer).
- New src/lib/markdownReport.js: shared renderer extracted from the export
  route (now used by both manual export and auto-flush — no duplication).
- Combos page: 'Markdown Request Log' card with enable toggle + interval.

Tests: tests/unit/markdown-log.test.js — 2 tests verifying real file write
with per-conversation content when enabled, skip when disabled. All pass.

Part of: Observability & Conversation Analytics plan (Phase P3)


